WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.334 --> 00:00:03.734
-Donald Trump made it clear
this weekend

00:00:03.734 --> 00:00:05.100
that he is leading
a pro-coup movement

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:07.000
intent on dismantling
American democracy.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:09.934
First he promised to pardon
the January 6th defendants

00:00:09.934 --> 00:00:11.267
if he wins in 2024

00:00:11.267 --> 00:00:12.701
and then admitted in a statement

00:00:12.701 --> 00:00:15.567
that he wanted Mike Pence
to overturn the 2020 election.

00:00:15.567 --> 00:00:17.734
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:17.734 --> 00:00:21.300
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:23.734
For a year now,
Trump and his cronies

00:00:23.734 --> 00:00:25.067
have insisted, ludicrously,

00:00:25.067 --> 00:00:27.834
that January 6th
was not an insurrection

00:00:27.834 --> 00:00:29.801
and that all they were
trying to do is follow the law.

00:00:29.801 --> 00:00:32.267
At one point, Trump even
referenced a debunked theory

00:00:32.267 --> 00:00:34.834
that Thomas Jefferson
had supposedly used his power

00:00:34.834 --> 00:00:36.334
to make himself president.

00:00:36.334 --> 00:00:41.501
-Mike, had he had the courage
to do what Thomas Jefferson did

00:00:41.501 --> 00:00:42.834
but a minor version?

00:00:42.834 --> 00:00:46.033
You know, Thomas Jefferson,
he kept Georgia.

00:00:46.033 --> 00:00:48.100
You know that?
He didn't send it back.

00:00:48.100 --> 00:00:49.567
There was a dispute.

00:00:49.567 --> 00:00:53.300
"Hear ye, hear ye,
the great state of Georgia

00:00:53.300 --> 00:00:57.767
is unable to properly
calculate its votes."

00:00:57.767 --> 00:00:59.868
Thomas Jefferson was sitting
where Mike was.

00:00:59.868 --> 00:01:02.334
Right where Mike --
You know what he said?

00:01:02.334 --> 00:01:06.267
"Hear ye, hear ye,
we will keep the votes

00:01:06.267 --> 00:01:07.501
of the great state of Georgia."

00:01:07.501 --> 00:01:09.934
He didn't send it back
to the legis-- No.

00:01:09.934 --> 00:01:13.634
All I wanted and a lot of people
wanted Mike to do

00:01:13.634 --> 00:01:15.567
is send them back.

00:01:15.567 --> 00:01:17.901
-He's never read a single
book in his life,

00:01:17.901 --> 00:01:21.133
so all he knows about
the founding fathers

00:01:21.133 --> 00:01:23.734
is they said,
"Hear ye, hear ye."

00:01:23.734 --> 00:01:25.334
He probably thinks
those powdered wigs

00:01:25.334 --> 00:01:26.667
were their real hair.

00:01:26.667 --> 00:01:28.934
"I asked my barber to give me
the George Washington.

00:01:28.934 --> 00:01:30.501
When I looked in the mirror,
I said, 'Mario,

00:01:30.501 --> 00:01:31.767
you've done it again.'

00:01:31.767 --> 00:01:33.701
[ Laughter ]

00:01:33.701 --> 00:01:37.667
Hear ye, hear ye to you, Mario."

00:01:37.667 --> 00:01:40.767
Also, you never want to hear
the words "hear ye, hear ye"

00:01:40.767 --> 00:01:42.367
with that accent.

00:01:42.367 --> 00:01:44.834
He sounds like a used-car
salesman doing a commercial

00:01:44.834 --> 00:01:46.200
for a Presidents' Day sale.

00:01:46.200 --> 00:01:47.200
"Hear ye, hear ye.

00:01:47.200 --> 00:01:49.601
Come on down
to Bobby Badabing's!

00:01:49.601 --> 00:01:50.834
Buick of Bay Ridge.

00:01:50.834 --> 00:01:53.100
Our prices are so low,
every time we sell one,

00:01:53.100 --> 00:01:54.734
it's a Thomas Paine in my ass.

00:01:54.734 --> 00:01:56.133
Oh!"

00:01:59.100 --> 00:02:01.400
But one thing you can
always count on with Trump

00:02:01.400 --> 00:02:03.534
is that eventually
he'll tire himself out

00:02:03.534 --> 00:02:04.601
and just confess.

00:02:04.601 --> 00:02:06.234
He can't help it.
He just blurts it out.

00:02:06.234 --> 00:02:08.467
He did it with collusion.
He did it with Ukraine.

00:02:08.467 --> 00:02:10.067
And that's exactly
what he did over the weekend

00:02:10.067 --> 00:02:12.968
in a statement where he admitted
he wanted his vice president,

00:02:12.968 --> 00:02:14.501
Mike Pence,
to overturn the election.

00:02:14.501 --> 00:02:17.067
-Former President Donald Trump
all but admitting

00:02:17.067 --> 00:02:20.133
he tried to overturn
the 2020 election,

00:02:20.133 --> 00:02:22.234
which he so decisively lost.

00:02:22.234 --> 00:02:24.834
Here is a statement
that he just put out.

00:02:24.834 --> 00:02:26.300
"If the Vice President,
Mike Pence,

00:02:26.300 --> 00:02:27.901
had absolutely no right
to change

00:02:27.901 --> 00:02:30.133
the presidential election
results in the Senate,

00:02:30.133 --> 00:02:32.567
despite fraud and many
other irregularities,

00:02:32.567 --> 00:02:34.834
how come the Democrats
and RINO Republicans,

00:02:34.834 --> 00:02:36.534
like wacky Susan Collins,

00:02:36.534 --> 00:02:39.033
are desperately
trying to pass legislation

00:02:39.033 --> 00:02:40.834
that will not allow
the vice president

00:02:40.834 --> 00:02:43.334
to change the results
of the election?

00:02:43.334 --> 00:02:46.067
Actually, what they are saying
is that Mike Pence

00:02:46.067 --> 00:02:47.968
did have the right
to change the election,

00:02:47.968 --> 00:02:50.968
and now they want to take
that right away."

00:02:50.968 --> 00:02:53.133
And this is key.
He added here in the statement,

00:02:53.133 --> 00:02:56.200
"Unfortunately,
he didn't exercise that power.

00:02:56.200 --> 00:03:00.167
He could have overturned
the election."

00:03:00.167 --> 00:03:02.000
-There's no crime
Trump could commit

00:03:02.000 --> 00:03:03.367
that he wouldn't
later confess to.

00:03:03.367 --> 00:03:06.167
He just exhausts all the excuses
until he decides,

00:03:06.167 --> 00:03:08.701
"Screw it, I'm guilty, baby."

00:03:08.701 --> 00:03:10.534
If it had been him
instead of OJ,

00:03:10.534 --> 00:03:12.300
the quote would have been,
"The gloves don't fit,

00:03:12.300 --> 00:03:14.534
but you don't need gloves
to stab a guy."

00:03:14.534 --> 00:03:17.234
[ Laughter ]

00:03:17.234 --> 00:03:19.267
But this is how it always
is with him.

00:03:19.267 --> 00:03:21.033
He stuns you by confessing

00:03:21.033 --> 00:03:23.400
and then hopes we'll just shrug
and let it go.

00:03:23.400 --> 00:03:25.434
It's like if in one
of those crime dramas

00:03:25.434 --> 00:03:27.334
starring Hugh Grant
the cops went to his house

00:03:27.334 --> 00:03:29.901
in the first episode all amped
up and ready to grill him

00:03:29.901 --> 00:03:32.767
and he just said, "Oh, yes,
I did murder my mistress.

00:03:32.767 --> 00:03:35.501
Frightfully --
Frightfully sorry.

00:03:35.501 --> 00:03:37.434
It won't happen again."

00:03:37.434 --> 00:03:41.267
Then they'd have to say, "Well,
then I guess you're free to go."

00:03:41.267 --> 00:03:42.734
So Trump is now admitting

00:03:42.734 --> 00:03:44.000
he wanted
to overturn the election,

00:03:44.000 --> 00:03:46.334
which, of course, resulted
in a violent insurrection

00:03:46.334 --> 00:03:48.300
that has so far produced
more than 700 arrests.

00:03:48.300 --> 00:03:50.467
And earlier this month,
the most serious charges yet

00:03:50.467 --> 00:03:52.033
were filed in that investigation

00:03:52.033 --> 00:03:53.968
when members
of a right-wing militia

00:03:53.968 --> 00:03:56.501
were charged
with seditious conspiracy.

00:03:56.501 --> 00:03:58.667
-11 members of the
far-right anti-government

00:03:58.667 --> 00:04:00.267
extremist group the Oath Keepers

00:04:00.267 --> 00:04:03.334
have been charged
with seditious conspiracy.

00:04:03.334 --> 00:04:06.467
-The leader of the far-right
extremist group the Oath Keepers

00:04:06.467 --> 00:04:08.734
is due to appear
in federal court.

00:04:08.734 --> 00:04:11.033
Stewart Rhodes
is one of 11 defendants

00:04:11.033 --> 00:04:12.234
who the Justice Department

00:04:12.234 --> 00:04:14.367
charged with sedition
on Thursday

00:04:14.367 --> 00:04:17.467
for their involvement
in the January 6th insurrection.

00:04:17.467 --> 00:04:19.467
-Sedition is a very
serious charge,

00:04:19.467 --> 00:04:21.033
especially for a group
with a name

00:04:21.033 --> 00:04:23.367
is dopey as the Oath Keepers.

00:04:23.367 --> 00:04:25.534
That sounds like a company
that sells purity rings

00:04:25.534 --> 00:04:28.167
to high schoolers in Utah.

00:04:28.167 --> 00:04:30.901
But one meeting someone sent a
message to the others that said,

00:04:30.901 --> 00:04:33.100
"Someone can tell me
if I'm crazy, but..."

00:04:33.100 --> 00:04:35.100
You are.

00:04:35.100 --> 00:04:36.934
Oh, wait. Sorry.
There was more to that.

00:04:36.934 --> 00:04:38.367
Let's go back.

00:04:44.667 --> 00:04:48.367
Ugh. I mean, I think we've
all been there, right?

00:04:48.367 --> 00:04:52.133
You know, you're about to lay
violent siege to the Capitol

00:04:52.133 --> 00:04:54.234
and worry that having
two backpacks

00:04:54.234 --> 00:04:56.834
will make you look stupid.

00:04:56.834 --> 00:04:58.000
The police I can handle.

00:04:58.000 --> 00:05:00.601
The fashion police,
on the other hand...

00:05:00.601 --> 00:05:02.300
Listening to these
seditionist morons

00:05:02.300 --> 00:05:04.834
talk about accessories is like
listening to the Joker say,

00:05:04.834 --> 00:05:06.000
"Is the purple suit too much?

00:05:06.000 --> 00:05:08.567
I mean, aren't I already
saying the same thing

00:05:08.567 --> 00:05:09.601
with the green hair
and the clown makeup?

00:05:09.601 --> 00:05:12.133
I'm just so over this."

00:05:12.133 --> 00:05:14.734
Also, what do you mean
a backpack for regular use?

00:05:14.734 --> 00:05:16.300
Are you also going
to night school?

00:05:16.300 --> 00:05:17.901
"Yeah, I'm just doing
malicious stuff for now,

00:05:17.901 --> 00:05:21.300
but eventually I want
to do air conditioner repair."

00:05:21.300 --> 00:05:23.534
Or is regular stuff snacks
and waters?

00:05:23.534 --> 00:05:25.100
And if so, just a tip.

00:05:25.100 --> 00:05:27.734
If you have one backpack
for ammo and another for snacks,

00:05:27.734 --> 00:05:30.400
make sure they look
totally different.

00:05:30.400 --> 00:05:32.067
"Hey, man, can you toss me
a KIND bar?"

00:05:32.067 --> 00:05:35.467
"Sure thing."
"No, grenade!"

00:05:35.467 --> 00:05:39.868
"Why'd I pull the pin
on a KIND bar?"

00:05:39.868 --> 00:05:41.701
These dangerous idiots
genuinely seem

00:05:41.701 --> 00:05:43.200
to think of themselves
as revolutionaries.

00:05:43.200 --> 00:05:44.667
At one point,
according to the indictment,

00:05:44.667 --> 00:05:47.701
someone pitched a plan to use
a boat to cross the Potomac,

00:05:47.701 --> 00:05:49.767
although clearly they hadn't
really thought it through.

00:05:51.601 --> 00:05:53.934
I can. Oh, sorry.
Again, there was more.

00:05:53.934 --> 00:05:55.067
Let's go back.

00:06:11.767 --> 00:06:14.968
First of all, how many people in
an Oath Keepers conference call

00:06:14.968 --> 00:06:16.334
have a boat on their trailer?

00:06:16.334 --> 00:06:19.234
I would assume all of them.

00:06:19.234 --> 00:06:21.667
I mean, that's like me walking
into my writers' room

00:06:21.667 --> 00:06:24.000
and asking, "Hey, does anyone
here have coffee breath

00:06:24.000 --> 00:06:25.667
and crippling anxiety?"

00:06:25.667 --> 00:06:28.534
[ Laughter ]

00:06:28.534 --> 00:06:31.400
The issue isn't
no one having a boat.

00:06:31.400 --> 00:06:33.434
It's far more likely
no one having a boat

00:06:33.434 --> 00:06:35.033
that's good
at sneaking up on people.

00:06:35.033 --> 00:06:37.634
They probably all have
those big-ass fan boats

00:06:37.634 --> 00:06:39.667
you drive illegally
in the Florida Everglades

00:06:39.667 --> 00:06:44.334
looking for snakes you can
trade online for Bitcoin.

00:06:44.334 --> 00:06:45.534
I'd love to see one of those

00:06:45.534 --> 00:06:47.734
