in the dead of night.

00:06:47.734 --> 00:06:50.434
"Remember, the element
of surprise is essential.

00:06:50.434 --> 00:06:54.334
Keep your voices to a whisper,
and success shall be ours.

00:06:54.334 --> 00:06:55.868
Now let's push off."

00:06:55.868 --> 00:06:58.968
[ Engine rumbling ]
"Oh [bleep]

00:06:58.968 --> 00:07:00.634
Turn it down."

00:07:02.968 --> 00:07:04.634
Also, I love how
that sentence starts.

00:07:04.634 --> 00:07:08.400
"Can't believe
I just thought of this."

00:07:08.400 --> 00:07:11.100
They're planning a violent coup
to overthrow American democracy,

00:07:11.100 --> 00:07:14.167
and they sound like they're
booking a layover in Dallas.

00:07:14.167 --> 00:07:15.901
"Honey, I can't believe
I just thought of this.

00:07:15.901 --> 00:07:19.601
Why don't we stay with
my Aunt Ida for a few nights?

00:07:19.601 --> 00:07:21.400
What do you mean she's crazy?

00:07:21.400 --> 00:07:24.501
Because she has two backpacks?

00:07:24.501 --> 00:07:27.000
But what is for regular stuff
and one is for coup stuff.

00:07:27.000 --> 00:07:29.667
Oh, so now coups are crazy."

00:07:29.667 --> 00:07:31.634
Anyway, these guys
were all charged with sedition,

00:07:31.634 --> 00:07:34.067
the most serious charges yet in
the investigation of the coup.

00:07:34.067 --> 00:07:36.634
And apparently,
if Donald Trump gets his way,

00:07:36.634 --> 00:07:39.067
he'll pardon those people,
a new promise he announced

00:07:39.067 --> 00:07:41.601
at another one of his unhinged
rallies over the weekend.

00:07:41.601 --> 00:07:44.200
-If I run and if I win,

00:07:44.200 --> 00:07:48.868
we will treat those people
from January 6th fairly.

00:07:48.868 --> 00:07:51.300
We will treat them fairly.

00:07:51.300 --> 00:07:55.367
And if it requires pardons,
we will give them pardons,

00:07:55.367 --> 00:07:59.734
because they are being treated
so unfairly.

00:07:59.734 --> 00:08:02.167
-Man, it is pretty sickening
to see a crowd full of people

00:08:02.167 --> 00:08:04.267
cheer for the January 6th
insurrectionists.

00:08:04.267 --> 00:08:06.133
Like, at some point,
you just have to admit

00:08:06.133 --> 00:08:08.234
this is a pro-insurrection
movement.

00:08:08.234 --> 00:08:10.667
If you're at a party and someone
starts doing cocaine

00:08:10.667 --> 00:08:12.601
and someone else says, "Hey,
can I get some of that cocaine,"

00:08:12.601 --> 00:08:14.667
