a cocaine party."

00:08:21.167 --> 00:08:22.801
"Oh, maybe it's not
just a cocaine party.

00:08:22.801 --> 00:08:23.834
Maybe there's some other stuff.

00:08:23.834 --> 00:08:25.167
Hey, Marty,
is there a cheese board?"

00:08:25.167 --> 00:08:27.133
"Oh, bro. I can't even think
about food right now."

00:08:27.133 --> 00:08:29.934
Yeah, it's a cocaine party.

00:08:29.934 --> 00:08:31.834
Also, you guys need
to make up your minds.

00:08:31.834 --> 00:08:35.067
Was January 6th a false flag
staged by the FBI?

00:08:35.067 --> 00:08:36.834
Was it infiltrated by antifa,

00:08:36.834 --> 00:08:39.968
or were they pro-Trump patriots
who deserve pardons?

00:08:39.968 --> 00:08:43.167
Because for a year now,
pro-Trump liars in the GOP

00:08:43.167 --> 00:08:44.868
and on Fox News
have been claiming

00:08:44.868 --> 00:08:47.868
that either antifa
or the FBI or both

00:08:47.868 --> 00:08:50.334
were actually responsible for
the violence on January 6th.

00:08:50.334 --> 00:08:53.000
-Some of the people who breached
