from Sarah Palin?

00:10:20.400 --> 00:10:23.200
[ Laughing ] Oh, man.
Only in New York.

00:10:23.200 --> 00:10:24.434
Anyway, the point is,

00:10:24.434 --> 00:10:26.367
these people can't even
get their story straight.

00:10:26.367 --> 00:10:28.467
And Trump has even been
