I've ever seen.

00:10:54.968 --> 00:10:58.400
I said, "Mike, I don't care
how many pillows you sell,

00:10:58.400 --> 00:11:00.868
and now you're selling slippers
and sheets.

00:11:00.868 --> 00:11:02.267
You're selling everything."

00:11:02.267 --> 00:11:03.601
I said, "I don't care."

00:11:03.601 --> 00:11:05.734
You can't afford
that much advertising.

00:11:05.734 --> 00:11:07.200
I think --
You know what he does?

00:11:07.200 --> 00:11:09.567
He waits till the show
is just ready to go on,

00:11:09.567 --> 00:11:11.300
any empty slot, he says,

00:11:11.300 --> 00:11:14.334
"I'll give you $200 for it,"
to Fox.

00:11:14.334 --> 00:11:16.400
-Just what that crowd
was there for --

00:11:16.400 --> 00:11:19.400
the details
of strategic ad buying.

00:11:19.400 --> 00:11:20.734
[ Laughter ]

00:11:20.734 --> 00:11:23.133
Man, I'd hate to be working
the ad sales phone

00:11:23.133 --> 00:11:24.701
when Lindell calls mid-show.

00:11:24.701 --> 00:11:26.400
"Hello?"
"This is Mike Lindell.

00:11:26.400 --> 00:11:29.167
And it looks like Hannity
is about to go to commercial,

00:11:29.167 --> 00:11:32.200
and I want the slot."

00:11:32.200 --> 00:11:34.434
"We usually sell
those a few months out."

00:11:34.434 --> 00:11:39.300
"Do you want
the 200 dollar bucks or not?"

00:11:39.300 --> 00:11:40.567
Also, I love how blown away

00:11:40.567 --> 00:11:42.501
Trump is that the guy
who sold pillows

00:11:42.501 --> 00:11:46.000
branched out
to slippers and sheets.

00:11:46.000 --> 00:11:48.167
It seems like it should be
a little more out there

00:11:48.167 --> 00:11:50.167
to get that level
of amazement from Trump.

00:11:50.167 --> 00:11:51.634
"He's not just
the pillow guy anymore.

00:11:51.634 --> 00:11:54.501
He sells everything --
crossbows,

00:11:54.501 --> 00:11:56.934
snake food,
X-rated snow globes.

00:11:56.934 --> 00:11:59.567
You love those.

00:11:59.567 --> 00:12:03.701
You're in for a treat when you
shake one of Mike's globes.

00:12:03.701 --> 00:12:06.300
The snow moves around,
and what you see --

00:12:06.300 --> 00:12:07.934
you can't believe what you see."

00:12:07.934 --> 00:12:09.267
[ Laughter ]

00:12:09.267 --> 00:12:11.968
Still, it's exciting that
Lindell is doing slippers now.

00:12:11.968 --> 00:12:13.601
If they're as comfortable
as his pillows,

00:12:13.601 --> 00:12:15.601
it probably sounds like this
when someone wearing them

00:12:15.601 --> 00:12:16.767
walks through a room.

00:12:16.767 --> 00:12:19.901
[ Clanging ]

00:12:19.901 --> 00:12:22.234
[ Laughter ]

00:12:22.234 --> 00:12:24.033
You know, you buy them
for spouses

00:12:24.033 --> 00:12:25.834
you think are sneaking out
in the middle of the night

00:12:25.834 --> 00:12:26.734
for affairs.

00:12:26.734 --> 00:12:28.667
[ Clang ]

00:12:28.667 --> 00:12:31.234
"Honey, are you
going somewhere?"

00:12:31.234 --> 00:12:33.100
"Uh, just to the bathroom.

00:12:33.100 --> 00:12:35.467
No-good stinking slippers."

00:12:35.467 --> 00:12:37.734
"Honey, come back to bed."
"Okay."

00:12:37.734 --> 00:12:40.000
[ Thud ]
"Whoa [bleep] pillow."

00:12:40.000 --> 00:12:42.334
[ Laughter ]

00:12:42.334 --> 00:12:45.567
I think that qualifies
as a play.

00:12:45.567 --> 00:12:47.167
Think I just did a play.

00:12:47.167 --> 00:12:48.968
[ Laughter ]

00:12:51.033 --> 00:12:54.100
Can it get a Tony
if it's on TV first?

00:12:54.100 --> 00:12:55.701
[ Laughter ]

00:12:55.701 --> 00:12:57.467
Well, look into it.

00:13:00.133 --> 00:13:01.701
It doesn't get any clearer
than this.

00:13:01.701 --> 00:13:03.033
Trump is confessing
that he wanted

00:13:03.033 --> 00:13:04.567
to overturn the 2020 election

00:13:04.567 --> 00:13:07.400
and promising to pardon
the rioters if he wins in 2024.

00:13:07.400 --> 00:13:09.100
It's openly a pro-coup movement.

00:13:09.100 --> 00:13:10.901
They're publicly declaring
that they're going to try to do

00:13:10.901 --> 00:13:12.334
the exact same thing next time.

00:13:12.334 --> 00:13:13.968
The only way they could announce
their intentions

00:13:13.968 --> 00:13:16.601
any more clearly is that they
started every sentence with...

00:13:16.601 --> 00:13:18.767
-Hear ye, hear ye.

00:13:18.767 --> 00:13:20.601
-This has been "A Closer Look."

00:13:24.367 --> 00:13:26.033
God's Love We Deliver cooks
and brings

00:13:26.033 --> 00:13:28.267
over 2 million meals a year
to men, women, and children

00:13:28.267 --> 00:13:31.501
living with HIV/AIDS, cancer,
and other serious illnesses,

00:13:31.501 --> 00:13:32.968
and they need your help
now more than ever.

00:13:32.968 --> 00:13:35.601
If you're watching this online,
you can hit the "donate" button.

00:13:35.601 --> 00:13:38.300
Stay safe. Get vaccinated.
We love you.

